<article class="policy">
<p class="eyebrow">STOCKLUMO / PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="caption">Updated 18 October 2026</p>
<p>Stocklumo is operated by Omar Hussain Fahmi. Questions or privacy requests: <a href="mailto:omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com">omarhussainfahmi@hotmail.com</a>.</p>
<h2>What stays in your browser</h2><p>Your theme, watchlist, recently viewed symbols, screener preset, hypothetical portfolio and analytics choice use local storage on this browser. They are not an account, do not sync between devices and remain until you clear them or your browser removes them. <a href="/settings">Download a backup</a> before clearing browser data.</p>
<h2>Requests needed to run the site</h2><p>Your browser sends stock symbols, searches, selected dates and ordinary connection information to Stocklumo to request market data. The server obtains data from Finnhub; the API key stays on the server. Portfolio quantities and purchase prices are calculated locally and are not sent to Finnhub.</p>
<p>Render hosts the website and processes network information such as IP addresses and requested URLs to deliver and protect it. Hosting and provider logs may be retained under their own policies. Stocklumo does not set a separate retention period for those providers' logs.</p>
<h2>Cookies, storage and optional analytics</h2><p>Stocklumo itself does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Browser storage supports the features you use. Hosting providers may use security technologies. Cloudflare Web Analytics is optional: its script loads only after you choose Allow analytics. It measures page visits, device/browser information and page performance; Cloudflare describes it as cookie-free and without cross-site visitor tracking.</p>
<p>You can reject analytics without losing features. We ask again after 180 days and honor browser Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control signals. Change your choice at any time using Cookie settings in the footer or <a href="/settings">Privacy &amp; backups</a>. Withdrawing consent reloads the page to stop the loaded analytics script; previously received aggregate measurements cannot be identified and removed as an individual profile.</p>
<h2>External services and links</h2><p>Finnhub, Render, Cloudflare, news publishers and LinkedIn have their own privacy practices. External links open those services; contacting us by email uses your email provider. Providers may process information in countries other than yours. See <a href="https://render.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Render privacy</a>, <a href="https://finnhub.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Finnhub provider information</a> and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare privacy</a>.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>Use your browser's storage controls to delete local data, and keep exported backups private. We do not sell personal information or run advertising profiles. Contact the email above for access, correction, deletion or other requests about information you have sent us. Rights and complaint options depend on your location; contact your local data-protection authority where applicable.</p>
</article>
